      "writtenOn": "2023-10-04T10:26:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any reason you\u0027re using ro.board.platform here instead of what AOSP uses (ro.boot.product.vendor.sku)? https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/main:system/libvintf/VintfObject.cpp;l\u003d383-400?q\u003d%22%2Fetc%2Fvintf%2F%22\u0026start\u003d21\n\nOn my device (Fairphone 5) ro.board.platform\u003dlahaina but it really needs the \u0027yupik\u0027 file, not lahaina one. On Android init.qti.qcv.sh+init.qti.qcv.rc set ro.boot.product.vendor.sku\u003dyupik so that it uses the correct manifest file.",
      "revId": "9106fb52cc2c66535705a6d4cdf45f9a58b2390e",
      "serverId": "9c1c7d72-6534-4d44-b0ea-39f63e804833"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8e10d1ef_3caebce3",
        "filename": "twrp-functions.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 32
      },
      "lineNbr": 1599,
